# GitHub shows "Cite this repository" from this file. Anyone using this work should cite the base paper first.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the original paper (preferred-citation) and this repository."
title: "Cetacean whistle reproduction: VAE-GMM for false killer whale whistles, and WhistleCode"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An independent, unofficial reproduction of Park et al. (IEEE Access, 2026), built as a student course project and
  not affiliated with the paper's authors. It covers preprocessing of NOAA DCLDE 2022 false killer whale recordings
  with a newly designed detector, VAE-GMM training and evaluation against the paper, a web demo, and WhistleCode, a
  simulated biomimetic message channel built on the trained model.
authors:
